{
  "type": "module",
  "source": "doc/api/tty.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "TTY",
      "name": "tty",
      "introduced_in": "v0.10.0",
      "stability": 2,
      "stabilityText": "Stable",
      "desc": "<p><strong>Source Code:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/v24.10.1/lib/tty.js\">lib/tty.js</a></p>\n<p><code>node:tty</code> 模块提供了 <code>tty.ReadStream</code> 和 <code>tty.WriteStream</code> 类。在大多数情况下，没有必要或可能直接使用此模块。但是，可以通过以下方式访问它：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const tty = require('node:tty');\n</code></pre>\n<p>当 Node.js 检测到它正在运行并附加了一个文本终端（\"TTY\"）时，默认情况下，<a href=\"process.html#processstdin\"><code>process.stdin</code></a> 将被初始化为 <code>tty.ReadStream</code> 的实例，而 <a href=\"process.html#processstdout\"><code>process.stdout</code></a> 和 <a href=\"process.html#processstderr\"><code>process.stderr</code></a> 默认情况下将是 <code>tty.WriteStream</code> 的实例。判断 Node.js 是否在 TTY 上下文中运行的推荐方法是检查 <code>process.stdout.isTTY</code> 属性的值是否为 <code>true</code>：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-console\">$ node -p -e \"Boolean(process.stdout.isTTY)\"\ntrue\n$ node -p -e \"Boolean(process.stdout.isTTY)\" | cat\nfalse\n</code></pre>\n<p>在大多数情况下，应用程序应该几乎没有理由手动创建 <code>tty.ReadStream</code> 和 <code>tty.WriteStream</code> 类的实例。</p>",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "类：`tty.ReadStream`",
          "name": "类：`tty.readstream`",
          "meta": {
            "added": [
              "v0.5.8"
            ],
            "changes": []
          },
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>继承自：<a href=\"net.html#class-netsocket\" class=\"type\">&lt;net.Socket&gt;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>表示 TTY 的可读端。在正常情况下，<a href=\"process.html#processstdin\"><code>process.stdin</code></a> 将是 Node.js 进程中唯一的 <code>tty.ReadStream</code> 实例，并且没有理由创建额外的实例。</p>",
          "properties": [
            {
              "textRaw": "`readStream.isRaw`",
              "name": "isRaw",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.7.7"
                ],
                "changes": []
              },
              "desc": "<p>一个 <code>boolean</code>，如果 TTY 当前配置为作为原始设备运行，则为 <code>true</code>。</p>\n<p>当进程启动时，此标志始终为 <code>false</code>，即使终端以原始模式运行。其值将随着后续调用 <code>setRawMode</code> 而改变。</p>"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "`readStream.isTTY`",
              "name": "isTTY",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.5.8"
                ],
                "changes": []
              },
              "desc": "<p>一个 <code>boolean</code>，对于 <code>tty.ReadStream</code> 实例始终为 <code>true</code>。</p>"
            }
          ],
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "`readStream.setRawMode(mode)`",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "setRawMode",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.7.7"
                ],
                "changes": []
              },
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`mode` {boolean} 如果为 `true`，则将 `tty.ReadStream` 配置为作为原始设备运行。如果为 `false`，则将 `tty.ReadStream` 配置为其默认模式运行。`readStream.isRaw` 属性将被设置为结果模式。",
                      "name": "mode",
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "desc": "如果为 `true`，则将 `tty.ReadStream` 配置为作为原始设备运行。如果为 `false`，则将 `tty.ReadStream` 配置为其默认模式运行。`readStream.isRaw` 属性将被设置为结果模式。"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "返回：{this} 读取流实例。",
                      "name": "返回：",
                      "type": "this",
                      "desc": "读取流实例。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>允许配置 <code>tty.ReadStream</code>，使其作为原始设备运行。</p>\n<p>在原始模式下，输入总是按字符可用，不包括修饰符。此外，终端对所有字符的特殊处理都被禁用，包括回显输入字符。在此模式下，<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd> 将不再导致 <code>SIGINT</code>。</p>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "类：`tty.ReadStream`"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "类：`tty.WriteStream`",
          "name": "类：`tty.writestream`",
          "meta": {
            "added": [
              "v0.5.8"
            ],
            "changes": []
          },
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>继承自：<a href=\"net.html#class-netsocket\" class=\"type\">&lt;net.Socket&gt;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>表示 TTY 的可写端。在正常情况下，<a href=\"process.html#processstdout\"><code>process.stdout</code></a> 和 <a href=\"process.html#processstderr\"><code>process.stderr</code></a> 将是 Node.js 进程创建的唯二 <code>tty.WriteStream</code> 实例，并且没有理由创建额外的实例。</p>",
          "ctors": [
            {
              "textRaw": "`new tty.ReadStream(fd[, options])`",
              "type": "ctor",
              "name": "tty.ReadStream",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.5.8"
                ],
                "changes": [
                  {
                    "version": "v0.9.4",
                    "description": "The `options` argument is supported."
                  }
                ]
              },
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`fd` {number} 与 TTY 关联的文件描述符。",
                      "name": "fd",
                      "type": "number",
                      "desc": "与 TTY 关联的文件描述符。"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`options` {Object} 传递给父类 `net.Socket` 的选项，参见 [`net.Socket` 构造函数][] 的 `options`。",
                      "name": "options",
                      "type": "Object",
                      "desc": "传递给父类 `net.Socket` 的选项，参见 [`net.Socket` 构造函数][] 的 `options`。"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "返回：{tty.ReadStream}",
                      "name": "返回：",
                      "type": "tty.ReadStream"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>为与 TTY 关联的 <code>fd</code> 创建一个 <code>ReadStream</code>。</p>"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "`new tty.WriteStream(fd)`",
              "type": "ctor",
              "name": "tty.WriteStream",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.5.8"
                ],
                "changes": []
              },
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`fd` {number} 与 TTY 关联的文件描述符。",
                      "name": "fd",
                      "type": "number",
                      "desc": "与 TTY 关联的文件描述符。"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "返回：{tty.WriteStream}",
                      "name": "返回：",
                      "type": "tty.WriteStream"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>为与 TTY 关联的 <code>fd</code> 创建一个 <code>WriteStream</code>。</p>"
            }
          ],
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "事件：`'resize'`",
              "name": "事件：`'resize'`",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.7.7"
                ],
                "changes": []
              },
              "desc": "<p>每当 <code>writeStream.columns</code> 或 <code>writeStream.rows</code> 属性发生变化时，就会触发 <code>'resize'</code> 事件。调用监听器回调时不传递任何参数。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\">process.stdout.on('resize', () => {\n  console.log('screen size has changed!');\n  console.log(`${process.stdout.columns}x${process.stdout.rows}`);\n});\n</code></pre>",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "事件：`'resize'`"
            }
          ],
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "`writeStream.clearLine(dir[, callback])`",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "clearLine",
              "meta": {
                "added": [
                  "v0.7.7"
                ],
                "changes": [
                  {
                    "version": "v12.7.0",
                    "pr-url": "https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/28721",
                    "description": "The stream's write() callback and return value are exposed."
                  }
                ]
              },
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`dir` {number}",
                      "name": "dir",
                      "type": "number",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "textRaw": "`-1`: 从光标向左",
                          "name": "-1",
                          "desc": "从光标向左"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "`1`: 从光标向右",
                          "name": "1",
                          "desc": "从光标向右"
                        },
                        {
                          "textRaw": "`0`: 整行",
                          "name": "0",
                          "desc": "整行"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "`callback` {Function} 操作完成后调用。",
                      "name": "callback",
                      "type": "Function",
                      "desc": "操作完成后调用。"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "返回：{boolean} 如果流希望调用代码在继续写入更多数据之前等待 `'drain'` 事件被触发，则为 `false`；否则为 `true`。",
                      "name": "返回：",
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "desc": "如果流希望调用代码在继续写入更多数据之前等待 `'drain'` 事件被触发，则为 `false`；否则为 `true`。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p><code>writeStream.clearLine()</code> 按 <code>dir</code> 标识的方向清除此 <code>WriteStream</code> 的当前行。</p>"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "`writeStream.clearScreenDown([callback])`",
              "type": "method",
